136
00:09:29,500 --> 00:09:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go back to the village.</font>

137
00:09:31,500 --> 00:09:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I'm just a mere monster now...</font>

138
00:09:36,090 --> 00:09:37,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not true!</font>

139
00:09:38,260 --> 00:09:39,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is agony...</font>

140
00:09:40,890 --> 00:09:41,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame...</font>

141
00:09:43,850 --> 00:09:46,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please... kill me...</font>

142
00:09:48,020 --> 00:09:50,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please... kill...</font>

143
00:09:53,070 --> 00:09:56,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How dare you try to kill me!</font>

144
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arashi nii-chan!</font>

145
00:09:58,990 --> 00:10:02,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll... die!</font>

146
00:10:20,590 --> 00:10:21,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-san!</font>

147
00:10:21,890 --> 00:10:23,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-san?!</font>

148
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:27,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You wanna be... the first to die?</font>

149
00:10:29,940 --> 00:10:31,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame taught me that...</font>

150
00:10:32,690 --> 00:10:34,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">dying isn't anything to be scared of!</font>

151
00:10:34,860 --> 00:10:35,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

152
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:43,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what's scary is to live one's life
without having been able to do anything...</font>

153
00:10:44,330 --> 00:10:48,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not afraid to die in the service
of someone who is important to me!</font>

154
00:10:48,870 --> 00:10:49,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't!</font>

155
00:10:52,330 --> 00:10:54,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you...</font>

156
00:10:54,710 --> 00:10:57,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever happens you mustn't die...
No matter what! Sakura-chan!</font>

157
00:10:59,010 --> 00:10:59,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

158
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:01,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give it up!</font>

159
00:11:02,260 --> 00:11:04,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it you think you're capable
of doing the way you are now?!</font>

160
00:11:12,230 --> 00:11:14,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's so useless!</font>

161
00:11:18,780 --> 00:11:22,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Vanish from this world,
get crushed into nothing...!</font>

162
00:11:22,490 --> 00:11:23,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame-chan!</font>

163
00:11:23,450 --> 00:11:25,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop that, Arashi nii-chan!</font>

164
00:11:26,700 --> 00:11:28,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame... you!</font>

165
00:11:41,930 --> 00:11:43,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

166
00:11:43,140 --> 00:11:44,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Let go!</font>

167
00:11:45,180 --> 00:11:46,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

168
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:21,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arashi nii-chan?!</font>

169
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:24,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Sasame...</font>

170
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:27,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I caused you so much hardship...</font>

171
00:12:28,310 --> 00:12:29,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No you haven't!</font>

172
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:33,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The person who experienced
the greatest hardship is you Arashi nii-chan!</font>

173
00:12:35,020 --> 00:12:38,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there anything I can do for you?</font>

174
00:12:38,940 --> 00:12:40,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I do for you?!</font>

175
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:43,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've already helped me
more than enough...</font>

176
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:46,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See... Thanks to you Sasame</font>

177
00:12:46,740 --> 00:12:48,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was able to return to being
the person I was in the past...</font>

178
00:12:55,460 --> 00:12:56,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

179
00:12:59,130 --> 00:13:00,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan...</font>

180
00:13:01,590 --> 00:13:04,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if it's to be of service
to someone...</font>

181
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:08,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no life that
should be lost for that!</font>

182
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:11,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

183
00:13:14,690 --> 00:13:16,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Run! Sakura-chan!</font>

184
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:25,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pervy Sage!</font>

185
00:13:25,650 --> 00:13:28,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to be late!</font>

186
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:31,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was faced with a number of obstacles
on my end too!</font>

187
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:33,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gimme a break...</font>

188
00:13:33,450 --> 00:13:35,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then...
Climb on, climb on!</font>

189
00:13:36,790 --> 00:13:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry! Let's get back above ground!</font>

190
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:48,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oops!</font>

191
00:13:49,090 --> 00:13:50,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame-chan!</font>

192
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:54,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's fine... She just fainted.</font>

193
00:13:57,310 --> 00:13:58,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun!</font>

194
00:14:00,060 --> 00:14:04,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru assigned us a mission...</font>

195
00:14:05,940 --> 00:14:07,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To make sure nobody takes Sasuke-kun back</font>

196
00:14:07,570 --> 00:14:09,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the Village Hidden in
the Leaves under any circumstances!</font>

197
00:14:10,820 --> 00:14:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then Sasuke-kun is...?!</font>

198
00:14:13,450 --> 00:14:15,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... He's alive!</font>

199
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:18,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru had to protect Sasuke-kun</font>

200
00:14:18,620 --> 00:14:23,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because he is his vital vessel which
he will possess in three years!</font>

201
00:14:25,260 --> 00:14:28,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arashi... nii-chan...</font>

202
00:14:29,340 --> 00:14:31,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arashi... This place is gonna collapse!</font>

203
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and come over here!</font>

204
00:14:41,810 --> 00:14:44,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm already just a puppet...</font>

205
00:14:44,110 --> 00:14:46,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I cannot live my life anywhere
except here.</font>

206
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Onii-chan...</font>

207
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:53,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

208
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:57,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! Arashi nii-chan!</font>

209
00:15:01,210 --> 00:15:02,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame...</font>

210
00:15:05,050 --> 00:15:06,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you.</font>

211
00:15:24,690 --> 00:15:28,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Including Arashi,
we've paid an extraordinary price but...</font>

212
00:15:29,070 --> 00:15:31,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Fuma Clan has been
able to cut itself free</font>

213
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:33,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from Orochimaru's spell...</font>

214
00:15:33,740 --> 00:15:36,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can start again anew.</font>

215
00:15:36,830 --> 00:15:39,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will rebuild the Clan again without fail!</font>

216
00:15:40,620 --> 00:15:44,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this life...
that Arashi nii-chan protected.</font>

217
00:15:49,380 --> 00:15:50,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

218
00:15:52,300 --> 00:15:54,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am truly indebted to you.</font>

219
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:56,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame-chan...</font>

220
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:01,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hanzaki, I'm leaving these two
in your hands!</font>

221
00:16:02,230 --> 00:16:05,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes sir!
Please take care along the road!</font>

222
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will.</font>

223
00:16:08,190 --> 00:16:10,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Thank you!
— We thank you!</font>

224
00:16:10,610 --> 00:16:11,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Take care!
— See you again!</font>

225
00:16:12,030 --> 00:16:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Hang in there!</font>

226
00:16:19,290 --> 00:16:22,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well we weren't able
to find Sasuke</font>

227
00:16:22,710 --> 00:16:25,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but at least we now know
that he's alive somewhere...</font>

228
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:28,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll have to settle for the fact
that we were able to ascertain</font>

229
00:16:28,380 --> 00:16:31,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the new information that we still have
a grace period of three years</font>

230
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:34,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">before he becomes a vessel
to be possessed by Orochimaru.</font>

231
00:16:36,140 --> 00:16:37,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

232
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:42,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame-chan knew what she needed
to do for her clan...</font>

233
00:16:42,980 --> 00:16:45,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But this time again all I did was cry.</font>

234
00:16:46,940 --> 00:16:49,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All I did was depend on Naruto...</font>

235
00:16:49,610 --> 00:16:50,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

236
00:16:52,190 --> 00:16:54,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You gave your best effort too!</font>

237
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:59,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I was just a ball and chain
to everyone...</font>

238
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:01,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wasn't capable of doing
anything alone...</font>

239
00:17:02,040 --> 00:17:03,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not true!</font>

240
00:17:05,500 --> 00:17:10,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seeing you give your best effort
like that gave me a lot of courage, Sakura-chan.</font>

241
00:17:12,970 --> 00:17:16,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you hadn't been there Sakura-chan,
I'd have been crushed just like that.</font>

242
00:17:17,590 --> 00:17:19,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's thanks to you, Sakura-chan!</font>

243
00:17:20,810 --> 00:17:22,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

244
00:17:23,430 --> 00:17:27,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow, you've grown into someone
who can say that sort of thing!</font>

245
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:33,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oww! I'm an injured man!
Treat me with a little more care!</font>

246
00:17:33,860 --> 00:17:35,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh yeah, that's right!</font>

247
00:17:38,740 --> 00:17:43,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All I was thinking about at that time
was protecting someone I cared about...</font>

248
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:52,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I'm capable of
doing right now...</font>

249
00:17:59,090 --> 00:18:00,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was thinking...</font>

250
00:18:00,550 --> 00:18:01,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

251
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:06,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are many variables such
as mission level</font>

252
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:09,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">or platoon's member structure...</font>

253
00:18:09,520 --> 00:18:11,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But no matter how small
a platoon might be</font>

254
00:18:11,690 --> 00:18:15,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think it's important to assign
one Medical Ninja to it...</font>

255
00:18:15,690 --> 00:18:17,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that already...</font>

256
00:18:18,030 --> 00:18:20,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wrote exactly the same thing
in a report long ago</font>

257
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:23,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">regarding the survival rate and mission
achievement rate of small platoons.</font>

258
00:18:24,620 --> 00:18:27,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's not that easy to
nurture Medical Ninja.</font>

259
00:18:31,250 --> 00:18:33,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They require a different set of skills
than that of fighting types Ninja...</font>

260
00:18:34,630 --> 00:18:37,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The minute perfection
of Chakra control</font>

261
00:18:38,130 --> 00:18:40,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the ability to assimilate a huge volume
of specialized knowledge</font>

262
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:44,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the brains to apply that in a broad way...
patience...</font>

263
00:18:44,890 --> 00:18:46,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there is the most important thing</font>

264
00:18:46,560 --> 00:18:50,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for Shinobi who are to develop
into a Medical Ninja...</font>

265
00:18:52,650 --> 00:18:55,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I'm busy right now so...</font>

266
00:18:58,400 --> 00:19:01,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The most important thing... huh?</font>

267
00:19:02,660 --> 00:19:05,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hidden Leaf Hospital
I'm all wrapped up in bandages again...</font>

268
00:19:06,540 --> 00:19:09,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way I can't even
hold chopsticks...</font>

269
00:19:09,750 --> 00:19:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan, when it's time for
my meal feed me, okay?</font>

270
00:19:14,630 --> 00:19:16,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll open up my mouth just like this and...</font>

271
00:19:17,130 --> 00:19:19,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Sakura-chan?</font>

272
00:19:23,510 --> 00:19:26,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry! I was just joking!</font>

273
00:19:26,770 --> 00:19:28,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry... Naruto...</font>

274
00:19:28,930 --> 00:19:29,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

275
00:19:33,730 --> 00:19:36,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is gonna mean that
I'll keep you waiting a little but...</font>

276
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:40,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next time I definitely won't...</font>

277
00:19:42,780 --> 00:19:44,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">be a ball and chain to you!</font>

278
00:19:51,160 --> 00:19:52,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

279
00:19:55,420 --> 00:19:56,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enter!</font>

280
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:04,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I came here with a request!</font>

281
00:20:05,100 --> 00:20:06,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

282
00:20:07,260 --> 00:20:09,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please make me your apprentice!</font>

283
00:20:30,450 --> 00:20:33,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're very desperate, aren't you?</font>

284
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:36,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haruno Sakura</font>

285
00:20:36,330 --> 00:20:40,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard from Kakashi that you have
a brilliant mind as well as will power!</font>

286
00:20:44,010 --> 00:20:44,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

287
00:20:47,600 --> 00:20:49,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But in exchange
I'm not gonna be easy on you!</font>

288
00:20:50,270 --> 00:20:51,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes ma'am!</font>

289
00:20:57,020 --> 00:20:58,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This recent mission...</font>

290
00:21:00,480 --> 00:21:03,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">looks like it wasn't wasted
on her after all.</font>

291
00:21:13,060 --> 00:21:17,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitotsu hitotsu omoidaseba</font></font></font></font>

292
00:21:13,060 --> 00:21:17,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">when I recalled the parts one by one,</font></font></font></font>

293
00:21:17,830 --> 00:21:24,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">subete wakatteita kigashite ita no ni</font></font></font></font>

